{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ansteches-ticket-booking-complete",
    "name": "Ansteches Ticket Booking API - Complete Collection",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Laravel Ticket Booking System with authentication and all endpoints.\n\n🔧 **ENVIRONMENT SETUP:**\nThis collection supports both LOCAL and PRODUCTION environments with easy switching.\n\n📍 **Quick Environment Switch:**\n1. **For LOCAL testing:** Set 'current_environment' variable to '{{local_url}}'\n2. **For PRODUCTION testing:** Set 'current_environment' variable to '{{production_url}}'\n\n🌍 **Environment Variables:**\n- production_url: https://ansteches.shop/api\n- local_url: http://127.0.0.1:8001/api\n- current_environment: {{local_url}} (default)\n\n🔐 **Authentication Tokens:**\n- admin_token: Admin user authentication\n- operator_token: Operator user authentication\n- user_token: Regular user authentication\n- auth_token: Current active token (auto-managed)\n\n✅ **COMPLETE API COVERAGE:**\n- 🔐 Authentication (Login/Register/Logout)\n- 👤 User Profile Management\n- 🗺️ Routes (Search & CRUD)\n- 🎫 Bookings (Complete CRUD)\n- 🎟️ Ticket Validation\n- 💳 Payment Integration (All callbacks)\n- 🚌 Vehicle Management (Complete CRUD)\n- 🏢 Operator Management (Complete CRUD - Admin only)\n- 👑 Admin Panel (Users, Bookings, Analytics)\n- 🔑 Password Reset Flow\n\n🚀 **Quick Start:**\n1. Import this collection\n2. Set environment (local/production)\n3. Run 'Login Admin' to get auth token\n4. Test any endpoint with proper authorization\n\n💡 **Pro Tips:**\n- Tokens are automatically managed by login endpoints\n- All CRUD operations are included for completeness\n- Operator management requires admin privileges\n- Use different tokens to test role-based access",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{auth_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
